# Protein-6 TLIPRPDTE - Release factor glutamine methyltrans (2B3T; X-ray; SAH + partner protein) - near substrate/SAM.  Open:  chimerax view.cxc
open protein_motif6_2B3T.pdb
set bgColor white
hide atoms
cartoon
color #1 #b0b0b0
color /B #d9b38c
show ligand
style ligand stick
color ligand byelement
color :0XU,NEA,QVR,SAH,SAM,SFG #b5651d
color :0XU,NEA,QVR,SAH,SAM,SFG byhetero
color /A:88-96 #238b45
show /A:88-96 atoms
style /A:88-96 stick
color /A:88-96 byhetero
hbonds /A:88-96 restrict /B | ligand reveal true color #303030 dashes 8 radius 0.05
2dlabel text "Protein-6 TLIPRPDTE - Release factor glutamine methyltrans (2B3T; X-ray; SAH + partner protein) - near substrate/SAM" xpos .03 ypos .04 size 14
lighting soft
graphics silhouettes true
view
